{
  "name": "Check for valid Hubspot contact email",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "When contact created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspotTrigger",
      "position": [
        540,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "eventsUi": {
          "eventValues": [
            {}
          ]
        },
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Get contact email address",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "position": [
        720,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "contactId": "={{$json[\"contactId\"] ? 151 : 151}}",
        "operation": "get",
        "additionalFields": {
          "properties": [
            "email"
          ],
          "propertyMode": "valueOnly"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "validate the email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.oneSimpleApi",
      "position": [
        900,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "utility",
        "emailAddress": "={{$json[\"properties\"][\"email\"][\"value\"]}}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "If email is suspicious",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "notes": "IF\ndeliverability is not good\nOR\nDomain is not valid\nOR\nEmail is Disposable",
      "position": [
        1080,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json[\"deliverability\"]}}",
              "value2": "GOOD",
              "operation": "notEqual"
            }
          ],
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json[\"is_domain_valid\"]}}"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{$json[\"is_email_disposable\"]}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "combineOperation": "any"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Send to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        1280,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=:warning: New Contact with Suspicious Email :warning:\n*Name: * {{$node[\"Item Lists\"].json[\"contact\"][\"fields\"][\"core\"][\"firstname\"][\"normalizedValue\"]}} {{$node[\"Item Lists\"].json[\"contact\"][\"fields\"][\"core\"][\"lastname\"][\"normalizedValue\"]}}\n*Email: * {{$node[\"Item Lists\"].json[\"contact\"][\"fields\"][\"core\"][\"email\"][\"normalizedValue\"]}}\n*Creator: * {{$node[\"Item Lists\"].json[\"contact\"][\"createdByUser\"]}}",
        "channel": "#hubspot-alerts",
        "attachments": [],
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "261f45ae-a9ed-54ee-8a8d-6eb1490fbc1a",
      "name": "Publication · Overview and setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Check for valid Hubspot contact email\n\n## Purpose and structure\nThis folder contains the **Check for valid Hubspot contact email** workflow. Its executable nodes use `hubspot`, `hubspotTrigger`, `if`, `oneSimpleApi`, `slack`. The table and connection map below are derived from the JSON, not an inferred guarantee of behavior.\n\n## Setup\nImport inactive. Configure your own credentials and replace REPLACE_WITH_* values. Review external destinations and Code nodes before running.\n\n## Entry points\nWhen contact created\n\n## Verification\nSanitized source candidate; not runtime-tested. This overview is generated from node metadata. Read the folder README for the connection map, credential types, and license.\n\n## Attribution\nhttps://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows/blob/94007c1445d9258a7da116646b79473e7c7c3282/workflows/Slack/1172_Slack_HubSpot_Send_Triggered.json\nMIT; preserve source notices.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 800,
        "color": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "connections": {
